SUMMARY:An Evening with Tom Rush
LOCATION:Bombyx\, 130 Pine St\, Florence\, MA 01062
DESCRIPTION:Accompanied by Matt Nakoa and Brendan Cleary\nTom Rush is a gif
 ted musician and performer\, whose shows offer a musical celebration…a j
 ourney into the tradition and spectrum of what music has been\, can be\, a
 nd will become. His distinctive guitar style\, wry humour and warm\, expre
 ssive voice have made him both a legend and a lure to audiences around the
  world. His shows are filled with the rib-aching laughter of terrific stor
 y-telling\, the sweet melancholy of ballads and the passion of gritty blue
 s.\nhttps://bombyx.live/events/an-evening-with-tom-rush-2/\nFrom Pushpin W
 estern Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://bombyx.live/events/an-evening-with-tom-rush-2/
END:VEVENT
