SUMMARY:Paul Winter Consort | Matinee Concert
LOCATION:Bombyx\, 130 Pine St\, Florence\, MA 01062
DESCRIPTION:Celebrating The Winter Solstice\n++ The Matinee show is current
 ly sold out but tickets to the Evening Concert are still available ++ In 1
 980\, Paul Winter and the Consort were invited to be artists-in-residence 
 at New York’s Cathedral of St. John the Divine. Paul Winter explains: 
 “The dean had a personal mission to create a bridge between spirituality
  and ecology. He appreciated our music\, but I think it was the ecological
  dimension of our repertoire that convinced him we could be part of the Ca
 thedral. The premise of the invitation was entirely secular\; it was not t
 o have us play liturgical music. We could present any events we wanted\, a
 s long as we produced them ourselves.”\nhttps://bombyx.live/events/paul-
 winter-consort-matinee-concert/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpi
 n.city/westernma/
URL:https://bombyx.live/events/paul-winter-consort-matinee-concert/
END:VEVENT
