SUMMARY:Secret Planet: Kayhan Kalhor
LOCATION:Bombyx\, 130 Pine St\, Florence\, MA 01062
DESCRIPTION:A master of Persian classical music\nKayhan Kalhor is an intern
 ationally acclaimed virtuoso and the world’s leading player of the kaman
 cheh\, the Persian spike fiddle. He can hold a room spellbound with the in
 strument for an hour of unbroken improvisation. Through his many collabora
 tions\, he has been instrumental in popularizing Persian music in the West
  and remains a creative force in today’s global music scene. His perform
 ances of traditional Persian music and innovative cross-cultural projects 
 have captivated audiences worldwide.\nhttps://bombyx.live/events/secret-pl
 anet-kayhan-kalhor/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/weste
 rnma/
URL:https://bombyx.live/events/secret-planet-kayhan-kalhor/
END:VEVENT
