SUMMARY:Dura Mater in the Valley—Evening Reading Marathon
LOCATION:Bombyx\, 130 Pine St\, Florence\, MA 01062
DESCRIPTION:In recognition and celebration of a day-long communal experimen
 t in spontaneous durational writing organized by poets Sara Jane Stoner an
 d Ari Banias\, Dura Mater’s public marathon reading will feature partici
 pants sharing excerpts of their new writing emerging from the day. Come an
 d hear the converging\, overlapping\, divergent\, wild resonances and text
 ures that writing together can produce. A few additional reading slots wil
 l be available for members of the community who would like to join in shar
 ing their own writing.\nhttps://bombyx.live/events/dura-mater-in-the-valle
 y-evening-reading-marathon/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.ci
 ty/westernma/
URL:https://bombyx.live/events/dura-mater-in-the-valley-evening-reading-mar
 athon/
