SUMMARY:Jazz Shares: Jason Robinson
LOCATION:Bombyx\, 130 Pine St\, Florence\, MA 01062
DESCRIPTION:Blue Salience: For Yusef Lateef\nBlue Salience: For Yusef Latee
 f\, is Jason Robinson’s epic tribute to the late Dr. Yusef Lateef\, feat
 uring an astonishing range of compositional\, improvisatory\, and sound ap
 proaches for his 17-piece Janus Orchestra. The concert features leading fi
 gures in the jazz and creative music scenes of New York\, Boston\, and Lat
 eef’s long-time home of western Massachusetts.\nhttps://bombyx.live/even
 ts/jazz-shares-jason-robinson/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin
